WEBVTT

00:03:28.913 --> 00:03:31.666
What started as an idea from just one

00:03:31.707 --> 00:03:33.876
has grown into a collective movement

00:03:33.918 --> 00:03:39.507
of eight, then 19
and now 44 future homeowners.

00:03:39.548 --> 00:03:41.592
All through word of mouth.

00:03:41.634 --> 00:03:43.261
And we have a waitlist of over --

00:03:43.302 --> 00:03:44.303
(Applause)

00:03:44.303 --> 00:03:45.304
Thank you.

00:03:47.306 --> 00:03:48.557
Thank you.

00:03:49.392 --> 00:03:52.019
And we now have a waitlist
of over 100 people

00:03:52.019 --> 00:03:54.647
wanting to join our intentional community.

00:03:55.773 --> 00:03:57.358
Like Yolanda,

00:03:57.358 --> 00:04:01.070
who's ready to buy a home
to leave a legacy for her daughters.